eogroove", "keywords": ["interactive", "surreal", "theremin", "sound", "meditative"], "long_description": "# What is it?\nThis audiovisual experience transforms the room around you into a dynamic landscape of shapes and sculptures. Virtually touching these objects generates movement, sounds, and patterns, leading to an experience that evolves with your exploration.\n\n# Inspiration\nGeogroove evolved from a series of experiments building unique instruments in virtual reality. I wanted to explore music creation and performance in VR, while bringing that same experience into the 'real world'. This has been shown in live settings, where 1-2 people perform together using this virtual instrument.\n\n# Exhibitions\n\n**Filmgate Interactive 2024 (Miami, FL)**\n\n**Bumbershoot Arts and Music Festival 2024 (Seattle, WA)**\n\n{2400696887097528}", "short_description": "An abstract audiovisual experience in mixed reality. In this 5 minute looping experience, a series of 4 different instruments enter and exit the space around you."}]}, "developer_name": "Virtual Pebble Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.virtualpebble.studio/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Pebble Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.virtualpebble.studio/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes":